1
00:00:15,724 --> 00:00:17,141
- Kenal dia?
- Orlando Diaz.

2
00:00:17,142 --> 00:00:19,018
Kami rawat sebelum ini.

3
00:00:19,019 --> 00:00:20,102
- Jatuh?
- 20 kaki.

4
00:00:20,103 --> 00:00:21,020
JAM 13
7.00 - 8.00 MALAM

5
00:00:21,021 --> 00:00:22,772
- Siapa nampak?
- Mereka cari

6
00:00:22,773 --> 00:00:24,440
selepas dia tak jawab radio.

7
00:00:24,441 --> 00:00:26,943
- Anak mata perlahan.
- Dia berkeras nak balik.

8
00:00:26,944 --> 00:00:29,530
Ikut kiraan saya. Tiga, dua, satu...

9
00:00:31,156 --> 00:00:33,199
Kes Dr. Ellis. Biar kami buat.

10
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,576
- Saya teruskan.
- Kesinambungan penjagaan.

11
00:00:35,577 --> 00:00:38,162
Dr. Al-Hashimi,
apa kata ikut Dr. Abbot?

12
00:00:38,163 --> 00:00:39,372
- Shen juga.
- Okey.

13
00:00:39,373 --> 00:00:40,791
Cakap jika perlu apa-apa.

14
00:00:41,667 --> 00:00:43,167
Paru-paru baik.

15
00:00:43,168 --> 00:00:45,795
Pelvis stabil.
Hematoma tib-fib kanan.

16
00:00:45,796 --> 00:00:47,214
Lengan kanan bengkok.

17
00:00:48,131 --> 00:00:50,341
TM pecah di kiri dan berdarah likat.

18
00:00:50,342 --> 00:00:51,717
Patah tengkorak basilar.

19
00:00:51,718 --> 00:00:53,678
Pesakit diabetes, jatuh 20 kaki.

20
00:00:53,679 --> 00:00:56,138
Tekanan darah, 204/98, nadi 56.

21
00:00:56,139 --> 00:00:57,723
Dr. Mohan, apa maksudnya?

22
00:00:57,724 --> 00:00:58,892
Saya sedang rawat.

23
00:00:59,893 --> 00:01:03,020
- Refleks Cushing.
- Akibat tekanan intrakranial.

24
00:01:03,021 --> 00:01:04,606
Ya, bawa ke CT segera.

25
00:01:05,357 --> 00:01:06,941
Tiada cecair bebas di perut.

26
00:01:06,942 --> 00:01:09,444
- Ada waris?
- Isteri dan tiga anak.

27
00:01:10,279 --> 00:01:14,449
- Ada kad untuk Robby?
- Dia tak nak kad atau hadiah.

28
00:01:14,950 --> 00:01:16,868
- Ada kek?
- Dia tak mahu juga.

29
00:01:17,536 --> 00:01:19,495
Teruknya. Saya perlukan kek.

30
00:01:19,496 --> 00:01:21,706
Pesakit cedera
ketika ICE serbu restoran.

31
00:01:21,707 --> 00:01:23,332
Jesse pula ditahan?

32
00:01:23,333 --> 00:01:25,751
- Dijatuhkan dan diikat.
- Tak guna.

33
00:01:25,752 --> 00:01:28,379
Crus, biasa dengan latihan
tanpa komputer?

34
00:01:28,380 --> 00:01:32,341
Ya, tak apa. Saya lebih suka
tiada semua itu. Selamat kembali.

35
00:01:32,342 --> 00:01:36,637
Untuk ujian makmal dan X-ray,
letak papan klip di sini.

36
00:01:36,638 --> 00:01:39,432
Kalau hanya
pesanan jururawat, di sini.

37
00:01:39,433 --> 00:01:41,100
Tolong tulis dengan kemas.

38
00:01:41,101 --> 00:01:44,646
- Monica, ini Nazely. Pelatih baharu.
- Saya tak perlu tahu.

39
00:01:45,188 --> 00:01:46,523
Gembira bertemu awak.

40
00:01:47,774 --> 00:01:48,942
Hanya kita, Jack.

41
00:01:49,401 --> 00:01:51,945
- Ya. Siapa senior kita?
- Dr. Henderson.

42
00:01:53,071 --> 00:01:55,906
Bagus. Syif malam dikawal "Crus".

43
00:01:55,907 --> 00:01:57,492
Awak tahu ICE bawa pesakit tadi?

44
00:01:58,619 --> 00:01:59,910
Ya? Bagaimana?

45
00:01:59,911 --> 00:02:02,330
Orang lain yang kena.
ICE tahan Jesse.

46
00:02:02,331 --> 00:02:04,749
- Untuk apa?
- Menyerang pegawai.

47
00:02:04,750 --> 00:02:06,208
Biar betul?

48
00:02:06,209 --> 00:02:07,335
Dr. Al-Hashimi,

49
00:02:07,336 --> 00:02:09,837
- Nazely Toomarian, pelatih baharu.
- Hai.

50
00:02:09,838 --> 00:02:11,298
Salam kenal.

51
00:02:12,466 --> 00:02:13,966
Awak berbahasa Armenia?

52
00:02:13,967 --> 00:02:15,969
Bolehlah. Cukup untuk bersembang.

53
00:02:16,345 --> 00:02:18,013
Okey, mari kita berkumpul.

54
00:02:18,722 --> 00:02:21,015
Sebelum mula,
perkara ini paling penting.

55
00:02:21,016 --> 00:02:24,268
Bagi awak yang tak tahu,
Jesse cuba campur tangan

56
00:02:24,269 --> 00:02:26,270
semasa ejen tarik pesakitnya

57
00:02:26,271 --> 00:02:28,898
dan mereka berdua
telah ditahan oleh ICE.

58
00:02:28,899 --> 00:02:31,442
- Dia menumbuk?
- Hulur tangan untuk halang.

59
00:02:31,443 --> 00:02:34,195
- Dia buat sentuhan fizikal.
- Lebih lagi.

60
00:02:34,196 --> 00:02:37,281
Peguam hospital tanganinya,
kami akan beri taklimat staf

61
00:02:37,282 --> 00:02:39,992
setiap 12 jam
dengan kemas kini rasmi.

62
00:02:39,993 --> 00:02:42,578
Sementara itu,
jangan sebar khabar angin.

63
00:02:42,579 --> 00:02:44,997
Kamu mungkin dengar
jururawat baharu, Emma,

64
00:02:44,998 --> 00:02:47,416
- diserang oleh pesakit.
- Saya okey.

65
00:02:47,417 --> 00:02:49,001
Jangan lupa "kod hula hoop".

66
00:02:49,002 --> 00:02:52,630
Bagi pesakit berisiko,
pastikan laluan ke pintu kosong.

67
00:02:52,631 --> 00:02:56,133
Bunyi macam hari yang teruk
dan sistem masih lumpuh,

68
00:02:56,134 --> 00:02:59,261
jadi syif siang perlu beritahu
syif malam tentang protokol...

69
00:02:59,262 --> 00:03:00,513
- Ya.
- Hei.

70
00:03:00,514 --> 00:03:01,807
Bagus.

71
00:03:02,557 --> 00:03:03,600
Syukurlah.

72
00:03:04,726 --> 00:03:07,770
Jangan gembira sangat.
Setiap carta dari lima jam lalu

73
00:03:07,771 --> 00:03:10,231
perlu diimbas
ke Rekod Kesihatan Elektronik

74
00:03:10,232 --> 00:03:12,149
dan diperiksa ketepatannya...

75
00:03:12,150 --> 00:03:14,360
- Okey, kerja siapa?
- Syif siang.

76
00:03:14,361 --> 00:03:16,487
...dengan lembaran T lengkap.

77
00:03:16,488 --> 00:03:17,988
- Serius?
- Ambil masa lama.

78
00:03:17,989 --> 00:03:20,951
Kami akan sediakan stesen.
Okey, mari mulakan.

79
00:03:21,493 --> 00:03:22,910
Triaj ketinggalan 20 orang.

80
00:03:22,911 --> 00:03:24,829
Saya perlu tolong, tak meronda.

81
00:03:24,830 --> 00:03:27,624
- Mujurlah.
- Nak sertai mereka?

82
00:03:29,751 --> 00:03:30,960
Boleh tengok keajaiban.

83
00:03:30,961 --> 00:03:33,379
Macam Pertukaran Pengawal
di Istana Buckingham.

84
00:03:33,380 --> 00:03:36,758
- Kita boleh senyum.
- "Senyumlah, walau hatimu sakit."

85
00:03:38,343 --> 00:03:41,263
Filem biasa, tib-fib kanan
dan lengan kanan selepas CT.

86
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:43,681
Ujian Chem 8. Gula darah, 284.

87
00:03:43,682 --> 00:03:46,309
Tak teruk sangat.
Kalium nampak bagus.

88
00:03:46,768 --> 00:03:48,477
Jurang anion meningkat 14.

89
00:03:48,478 --> 00:03:50,856
Cuma 24 pagi tadi. Dia semakin pulih.

90
00:03:51,398 --> 00:03:53,942
- DKA makin pulih.
- Apa punca dia pengsan?

91
00:03:54,693 --> 00:03:55,861
Sangat panas di luar.

92
00:03:56,361 --> 00:03:58,446
Mungkin dehidrasi akibat berpeluh,

93
00:03:58,447 --> 00:04:01,032
sebab N-STEMI atau CVA posterior.

94
00:04:01,742 --> 00:04:02,617
Sedia bertolak.

95
00:04:05,078 --> 00:04:07,788
- Saya boleh jaga di CT.
- Terima kasih.

96
00:04:07,789 --> 00:04:09,750
Saya tunggu jika perlu bedah.

97
00:04:12,085 --> 00:04:14,671
- Hei, sistem pulih.
- Tepat pada masanya.

98
00:04:16,214 --> 00:04:17,173
- Robby.
- Ya?

99
00:04:17,174 --> 00:04:18,759
Saya tahu ke mana ICE bawa Jesse.

100
00:04:19,468 --> 00:04:22,678
- Siapa beritahu?
- Abang ipar saya polis.

101
00:04:22,679 --> 00:04:24,930
Jesse diproses di DHS Southside,

102
00:04:24,931 --> 00:04:27,516
kemudian ke tahanan ICE
di Clearfield.

103
00:04:27,517 --> 00:04:28,894
Clearfield? Dua jam jauh.

104
00:04:30,270 --> 00:04:32,354
Saya akan beritahu peguam.

105
00:04:32,355 --> 00:04:34,482
- Apa khabar, Oliver?
- Masih hidup.

106
00:04:34,483 --> 00:04:38,027
En. Haas.
Edema pulmonari, terlepas dialisis.

107
00:04:38,028 --> 00:04:40,571
Kini stabil dengan anaknya, Mason.

108
00:04:40,572 --> 00:04:42,949
- Hai.
- Saya Dr. Shen. Saya akan kembali.

109
00:04:43,658 --> 00:04:46,285
Juruteknik kata,
selesai dialisis pukul 10.42.

110
00:04:46,286 --> 00:04:47,746
Tekan lampu panggilan nanti.

111
00:04:48,455 --> 00:04:50,040
Seterusnya, Selatan 21.

112
00:04:52,459 --> 00:04:53,627
En. Digby.

113
00:04:54,336 --> 00:04:55,795
Digby dah cukup.

114
00:04:55,796 --> 00:04:58,756
Pesakit Dr. Mohan.
Selulitis lengan bawah,

115
00:04:58,757 --> 00:05:01,342
- diberi ubat. Tunggu katil.
- Saya boleh ambil.

116
00:05:01,343 --> 00:05:04,262
Dijual kepada Dr. Toomarian.
Teruskan rondaan.

117
00:05:05,597 --> 00:05:08,183
Dapat makan secukupnya?
Kami akan kembali.

118
00:05:09,684 --> 00:05:13,145
Lillian Stegman.
Cedera lutut akibat ski air.

119
00:05:13,146 --> 00:05:15,356
Pusingan 360 darjah,
tanjakan lima kaki.

120
00:05:15,357 --> 00:05:16,524
Tabik.

121
00:05:16,525 --> 00:05:19,235
- X-ray ketika di triaj.
- Beberapa jam lalu.

122
00:05:19,236 --> 00:05:22,739
Saya Dr. Crus Henderson.
Puan akan balik segera.

123
00:05:23,615 --> 00:05:24,615
Pasti bagus.

124
00:05:24,616 --> 00:05:26,159
- Okey, Utara.
- Terima kasih.

125
00:05:27,202 --> 00:05:29,662
Stesen imbasan pertama hampir siap.

126
00:05:29,663 --> 00:05:32,581
Whitaker, Santos,
buat imbasan dokumen di sini.

127
00:05:32,582 --> 00:05:35,292
- Serius?
- Berapa lama?

128
00:05:35,293 --> 00:05:36,795
Sehingga selesai.

129
00:05:37,337 --> 00:05:38,380
Kita sambung.

130
00:05:38,964 --> 00:05:42,258
Okey. Sekarang awak dah tahu
tentang rondaan pesakit.

131
00:05:42,259 --> 00:05:43,426
Menarik, bukan?

132
00:05:45,095 --> 00:05:47,639
- Ya.
- Ada sesuatu yang lebih baik.

133
00:05:49,599 --> 00:05:52,560
Digby, kami akan carikan awak
pakaian baharu,

134
00:05:52,561 --> 00:05:53,853
tapi kami nak tahu

135
00:05:53,854 --> 00:05:55,730
jika awak nak dibersihkan dulu?

136
00:05:57,023 --> 00:05:58,649
Saya sudah mandi.

137
00:05:58,650 --> 00:06:00,234
Ya, awak nampak elok.

138
00:06:00,235 --> 00:06:03,571
Tapi tawaran ini disertakan
cukuran dan potongan rambut.

139
00:06:03,572 --> 00:06:05,907
Saya tak paksa.
Lagipun, awak dah kemas.

140
00:06:07,409 --> 00:06:09,995
- Okey, saya mahu.
- Bagus.

141
00:06:10,579 --> 00:06:13,707
Okey. Isi besen dengan air suam
dan sabunkan mukanya.

142
00:06:17,168 --> 00:06:19,670
- Hei, jaga diri.
- Awak pun sama.

143
00:06:19,671 --> 00:06:20,547
Hei, Carrie.

144
00:06:21,631 --> 00:06:23,674
Awak pergi ke gudang itu, bukan?

145
00:06:23,675 --> 00:06:26,135
Perasan apa-apa
tentang cara dia jatuh?

146
00:06:26,136 --> 00:06:28,013
- Macam apa?
- Macam...

147
00:06:29,139 --> 00:06:33,226
Ada selusur rosak
atau ada kamera keselamatan?

148
00:06:33,852 --> 00:06:38,105
Terlalu sibuk merawatnya.
IV, intubasi, papan belakang, anduh.

149
00:06:38,106 --> 00:06:39,065
Terima kasih.

150
00:06:39,399 --> 00:06:42,151
Dah ada dua nama.
Tak lama lagi, tak perlu papan klip.

151
00:06:42,152 --> 00:06:43,528
Bayi Jane Doe di pediatrik?

152
00:06:44,529 --> 00:06:48,490
Ya. Ditinggalkan di tandas
ruang menunggu pada 7.30 pagi.

153
00:06:48,491 --> 00:06:50,659
- Untuk diserahkan?
- Dah lebih umur.

154
00:06:50,660 --> 00:06:52,536
- Mungkin dua bulan.
- Saya uruskan.

155
00:06:52,537 --> 00:06:54,705
Menunggu penempatan oleh CYF.

156
00:06:54,706 --> 00:06:57,166
- Jika ibunya kembali?
- Hubungi polis?

157
00:06:57,167 --> 00:07:00,586
Syif siang, imbas fail.
Syif malam, nombor bilik di atas

158
00:07:00,587 --> 00:07:02,254
bermaksud perlu doktor.

159
00:07:02,255 --> 00:07:05,424
- Siapa di BH-1?
- Tahanan mental, bahaya diri.

160
00:07:05,425 --> 00:07:06,550
Apa ceritanya?

161
00:07:06,551 --> 00:07:08,469
Dr. King dan Langdon kendalikan.

162
00:07:08,470 --> 00:07:11,513
Kasihan. Dia kata anaknya
berusia lima tahun menyelinap

163
00:07:11,514 --> 00:07:14,266
- kerusi belakang kereta untuk tidur.
- Strok haba.

164
00:07:14,267 --> 00:07:16,644
Ibunya hilang kawalan,
keluar ke jalan raya.

165
00:07:16,645 --> 00:07:19,813
Grady Barnhill, berdehit,
tiada respons terhadap albuterol.

166
00:07:19,814 --> 00:07:23,108
- Oksigen nadi, 87. Ibunya, Naomi.
- Trauma Dua kosong.

167
00:07:23,109 --> 00:07:25,277
Okey. Ada sejarah asma?

168
00:07:25,278 --> 00:07:28,530
- Ya. Tak pernah seteruk ini.
- Hampir tak bernafas.

169
00:07:28,531 --> 00:07:30,533
Dia guna semua otot bantuan.

170
00:07:31,493 --> 00:07:32,535
Panggil pasukan.

171
00:07:33,203 --> 00:07:35,621
Nebulizer berterusan, 20mg sejam.

172
00:07:35,622 --> 00:07:38,333
Kami ada nebulizer.
Beri albuterol setiap jam.

173
00:07:40,085 --> 00:07:43,254
Sedia? Ikut kiraan saya.
Satu, dua, tiga.

174
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:45,631
Dia ambil ubat lain?

175
00:07:45,632 --> 00:07:48,634
Hanya albuterol.
Dulu montelukast dan Symbicort.

176
00:07:48,635 --> 00:07:49,843
Kenapa hentikan?

177
00:07:49,844 --> 00:07:51,929
Sebab dah tak dapat Medicaid.

178
00:07:51,930 --> 00:07:53,722
Salur sempit, tak tembus.

179
00:07:53,723 --> 00:07:55,474
- Mel, EpiPen.
- Baik.

180
00:07:55,475 --> 00:07:56,809
0.3 miligram.

181
00:07:56,810 --> 00:07:58,478
Itu boleh buka paru-parunya.

182
00:08:00,188 --> 00:08:01,189
Grady, suntik paha.

183
00:08:06,820 --> 00:08:07,737
Hai.

184
00:08:08,989 --> 00:08:10,322
Nak imbas?

185
00:08:10,323 --> 00:08:12,157
Makmal kritikal, Utara Tiga.

186
00:08:12,158 --> 00:08:14,661
- Bukan saya punya.
- Nanti jadi pesakit saya.

187
00:08:16,663 --> 00:08:18,707
Saya dah habis kerja, jadi...

188
00:08:19,207 --> 00:08:21,625
Dipesan tiga jam lalu di triaj.

189
00:08:21,626 --> 00:08:23,795
Maksudnya, pesakit syif siang.

190
00:08:24,337 --> 00:08:25,462
Suruh pelatih buat.

191
00:08:25,463 --> 00:08:28,383
Saya nak jumpa pentadbiran
untuk selesaikan.

192
00:08:29,050 --> 00:08:31,010
Maaf, orang lain sibuk.

193
00:08:31,011 --> 00:08:34,430
Tak apa. Bagaimana awak dapat
syif malam untuk giliran pertama?

194
00:08:34,431 --> 00:08:37,809
- Bertuah agaknya.
- Ya, jika awak suka filem seram.

195
00:08:38,518 --> 00:08:40,811
- Belajar di mana?
- UC Irvine.

196
00:08:40,812 --> 00:08:42,604
- California, bukan?
- Ya.

197
00:08:42,605 --> 00:08:45,024
- Pittsburgh agak berbeza.
- Lebih lembap.

198
00:08:45,025 --> 00:08:47,402
Ya, pasti okey selepas salji turun.

199
00:08:48,528 --> 00:08:50,071
Hai, Pn. Davis.

200
00:08:50,780 --> 00:08:52,823
Saya Dr. McKay. Ini doktor...

201
00:08:52,824 --> 00:08:54,492
- Toomarian.
- Helo.

202
00:08:55,410 --> 00:08:58,162
Keputusan tunjukkan hati awak radang.

203
00:08:58,163 --> 00:09:00,164
Sebab itu saya sangat mual?

204
00:09:00,165 --> 00:09:04,169
Betul. Awak perasan perubahan
pada warna kulit awak?

205
00:09:04,878 --> 00:09:07,046
Saya guna krim pemerang

206
00:09:07,047 --> 00:09:08,881
agar tak pucat pakai baju renang.

207
00:09:08,882 --> 00:09:11,467
Awak ingat nama produk itu?

208
00:09:11,468 --> 00:09:13,135
Mungkin ada bahan yang...

209
00:09:13,136 --> 00:09:17,057
Tak. Sepenuhnya semula jadi.
DHA daripada bit gula.

210
00:09:18,308 --> 00:09:20,268
Mengapa hati saya boleh radang?

211
00:09:20,685 --> 00:09:22,352
Ada banyak kemungkinan.

212
00:09:22,353 --> 00:09:24,313
Awak ambil ubat preskripsi?

213
00:09:24,314 --> 00:09:25,272
Tiada.

214
00:09:25,273 --> 00:09:26,690
- Tylenol?
- Tak.

215
00:09:26,691 --> 00:09:29,026
Kita perlu tanya tentang dadah.

216
00:09:29,027 --> 00:09:30,069
Tak pernah.

217
00:09:30,070 --> 00:09:33,031
- Kima atau tiram?
- Saya vegan.

218
00:09:33,740 --> 00:09:36,826
Selangkah demi selangkah, okey?
Kami akan kembali.

219
00:09:38,495 --> 00:09:41,121
- Digby, Haas, di papan elektronik.
- Kemajuan.

220
00:09:41,122 --> 00:09:43,124
Dia tunggu di koridor dari tadi?

221
00:09:43,875 --> 00:09:46,795
Okey, boleh beri dia
giliran seterusnya?

222
00:09:48,213 --> 00:09:49,130
Terima kasih.

223
00:09:50,507 --> 00:09:51,882
Duke pergi CT, masih tunggu.

224
00:09:51,883 --> 00:09:54,593
Ya, dia mungkin menunggu berjam-jam.

225
00:09:54,594 --> 00:09:56,596
Tengok. Dah pukul 7.15.

226
00:09:57,138 --> 00:09:58,889
Tinggal sikit kerja.

227
00:09:58,890 --> 00:10:01,643
Tak habis-habis kerja
macam hiasan makram.

228
00:10:02,268 --> 00:10:04,394
Ibu saya ada. Penuh satu dinding.

229
00:10:04,395 --> 00:10:06,772
Serius, balik dan mulakan perjalanan.

230
00:10:06,773 --> 00:10:09,608
Ya, awak pun.
Oh, ya. Awak suruh Lena balik.

231
00:10:09,609 --> 00:10:11,527
Awak nak cari pengganti dia

232
00:10:11,528 --> 00:10:14,280
- atau akan bekerja sampai pagi?
- Jika perlu.

233
00:10:15,198 --> 00:10:16,949
Jadi, tak apa awak buat kerja lebih,

234
00:10:16,950 --> 00:10:19,284
tapi saya pula tak boleh?

235
00:10:19,285 --> 00:10:20,537
- Robby.
- Minta diri.

236
00:10:22,622 --> 00:10:24,581
- Apa?
- Tiada subdural dan epidural.

237
00:10:24,582 --> 00:10:28,377
Pembengkakan otak merata
dengan mampatan ventrikel.

238
00:10:28,378 --> 00:10:30,338
Tulang serviks?
Dada, abdomen, pelvis?

239
00:10:30,713 --> 00:10:32,798
Kontusi peparu kiri,
tiada pendarahan.

240
00:10:32,799 --> 00:10:35,093
Saya selesai.
Saya panggil neurosurgeri.

241
00:10:35,552 --> 00:10:37,387
Mengapa perlu neurosurgeri?

242
00:10:38,012 --> 00:10:40,597
- Pantau.
- Mulakan. CVP dan talian arteri.

243
00:10:40,598 --> 00:10:41,474
Orlando.

244
00:10:42,433 --> 00:10:43,768
Picit tangan saya.

245
00:10:45,061 --> 00:10:46,103
Buka mata awak.

246
00:10:46,104 --> 00:10:48,730
Kami sudah tahu GCSnya tiga.

247
00:10:48,731 --> 00:10:50,774
Javadi, profilaksis antisawan?

248
00:10:50,775 --> 00:10:52,734
- Keppra, 20mg/kg.
- Sedang buat.

249
00:10:52,735 --> 00:10:55,321
Kena redakan bengkak otak.
Apa caranya?

250
00:10:56,865 --> 00:10:58,365
- Samira.
- Apa?

251
00:10:58,366 --> 00:11:00,326
Turunkan tekanan intrakranial?

252
00:11:01,661 --> 00:11:02,703
Manitol.

253
00:11:02,704 --> 00:11:04,621
Boleh jadi diuresis dan hipotensi.

254
00:11:04,622 --> 00:11:05,873
Salina hipertonik.

255
00:11:05,874 --> 00:11:08,459
23%. 50cc melalui saluran tengah.

256
00:11:10,420 --> 00:11:13,088
- Bunyi kuat.
- Dah lima minit sejak kena.

257
00:11:13,089 --> 00:11:16,216
- Ambil satu lagi EpiPen.
- Saturasi hampir 87.

258
00:11:16,217 --> 00:11:17,593
Jika BiPap? 10/5.

259
00:11:17,594 --> 00:11:19,304
Ya, nebulizer saluran.

260
00:11:19,929 --> 00:11:21,597
Grady, suntikan kedua.

261
00:11:21,598 --> 00:11:23,391
Tambah magnesium, 50mg/kg.

262
00:11:24,058 --> 00:11:26,269
Dia tak bernafas.
Patut sedia intubasi.

263
00:11:26,644 --> 00:11:29,355
Pesakit asma?
Risiko tinggi serangan jantung.

264
00:11:29,981 --> 00:11:32,065
Naomi, dia pernah guna
mesin pernafasan?

265
00:11:32,066 --> 00:11:33,609
- Tak pernah.
- Masuk wad?

266
00:11:33,610 --> 00:11:35,736
Tak, sentiasa reda guna Symbicort.

267
00:11:35,737 --> 00:11:37,487
Tunggu beberapa minit lagi

268
00:11:37,488 --> 00:11:38,573
untuk stabilkan.

269
00:11:42,327 --> 00:11:45,913
Saya boleh buat sendiri
sebab dah tanggal plaster.

270
00:11:45,914 --> 00:11:48,541
Tak apa. Saya tak kisah.

271
00:11:53,254 --> 00:11:54,839
Berapa lama awak jadi jururawat?

272
00:11:56,591 --> 00:11:57,675
Ini hari pertama.

273
00:12:00,929 --> 00:12:02,513
Awak sangat bagus.

274
00:12:04,891 --> 00:12:05,767
Terima kasih.

275
00:12:10,688 --> 00:12:13,732
- Alamak. Awak okey?
- Ya. Ada air di lantai.

276
00:12:13,733 --> 00:12:16,401
- Maaf, mungkin saya tumpahkan.
- Tak apa.

277
00:12:16,402 --> 00:12:19,614
Kita perlu susun ikut pesakit
sebelum imbas.

278
00:12:20,365 --> 00:12:23,033
Adakah Joy masih di sini?

279
00:12:23,034 --> 00:12:25,662
Saya dengar dia balik pukul 6.59.

280
00:12:26,037 --> 00:12:27,163
Gadis yang bijak.

281
00:12:27,956 --> 00:12:29,915
Cari Ogilvie. Dia pandai bodek.

282
00:12:29,916 --> 00:12:31,750
Dia mungkin boleh imbas carta.

283
00:12:31,751 --> 00:12:33,710
Dia masuk bilik bedah,

284
00:12:33,711 --> 00:12:35,671
kes <i>triple A</i> yang pecah.

285
00:12:35,672 --> 00:12:38,758
Kes salah sangka batu karang.
Paling kejap, empat jam.

286
00:12:41,261 --> 00:12:43,805
Awak masih pergi
ke rumah Amy selepas ini?

287
00:12:44,681 --> 00:12:46,431
Ya, mungkin untuk malam ini.

288
00:12:46,432 --> 00:12:48,685
Selepas Robby beritahu
tentang rumahnya.

289
00:12:49,852 --> 00:12:50,812
Macam seronok.

290
00:12:52,563 --> 00:12:54,690
Susah nak tolak permintaan dia.

291
00:12:54,691 --> 00:12:55,650
Betul.

292
00:12:58,361 --> 00:13:00,570
Pasti pelik tanpa dia di sini.

293
00:13:00,571 --> 00:13:01,406
Ya.

294
00:13:01,906 --> 00:13:03,992
Agaknya Dr. Al-Hashimi mampu ganti?

295
00:13:04,784 --> 00:13:06,995
- Secara ringkasnya, tak.
- Dia bijak.

296
00:13:07,453 --> 00:13:09,121
Perlukan lebih daripada itu.

297
00:13:09,122 --> 00:13:11,707
Sekurang-kurangnya, hanya tiga bulan.

298
00:13:11,708 --> 00:13:13,167
Tiga bulan yang panjang.

299
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,503
Kemudian, awak cari rumah baharu.

300
00:13:16,504 --> 00:13:20,590
Tak semestinya.
Saya cuma jagakan rumah Robby,

301
00:13:20,591 --> 00:13:22,635
sekali dua dalam sehari.

302
00:13:23,303 --> 00:13:24,387
Mengapa begitu?

303
00:13:26,222 --> 00:13:28,016
Entah. Mengapa tak boleh?

304
00:13:31,352 --> 00:13:34,689
- Hipertonik sudah masuk.
- Kekalkan LR dalam AC.

305
00:13:35,606 --> 00:13:36,732
Macam tanda halo.

306
00:13:36,733 --> 00:13:39,318
Cecair serebrospina
akibat patah basilar.

307
00:13:39,319 --> 00:13:43,739
Tanda halo tak sensitif
mahupun khusus untuk CSF.

308
00:13:43,740 --> 00:13:46,950
Salina, air paip dan hidung berair
terpisah daripada darah.

309
00:13:46,951 --> 00:13:48,327
- Helo, Linda.
- Robby.

310
00:13:48,328 --> 00:13:50,787
Ketua bahagian bekerja
pada cuti hujung minggu.

311
00:13:50,788 --> 00:13:51,956
Seseorang perlu buat.

312
00:13:53,082 --> 00:13:54,709
Pesakit ini perlukan EVD.

313
00:13:55,960 --> 00:13:58,003
Saliran ventrikel luar,
turunkan tekanan.

314
00:13:58,004 --> 00:14:00,715
CPP bersamaan dengan "MAP" tolak ICP.

315
00:14:01,424 --> 00:14:03,925
Tekanan perfusi serebrum di otak

316
00:14:03,926 --> 00:14:07,346
ialah tekanan arteri purata
tolak tekanan di dalam tengkorak.

317
00:14:07,347 --> 00:14:11,309
ICP kurang daripada 22,
menandakan peluang hidup lebih baik.

318
00:14:11,726 --> 00:14:16,104
CPP 60 hingga 70,
kurangkan morbiditi dan mortaliti.

319
00:14:16,105 --> 00:14:17,022
Siapa bantu?

320
00:14:17,023 --> 00:14:19,275
- Dr. Mohan?
- Tak apa.

321
00:14:20,818 --> 00:14:21,861
Awak patut bantu.

322
00:14:22,362 --> 00:14:23,279
Saya tak mahu.

323
00:14:24,155 --> 00:14:25,990
- Javadi?
- Saya rasa tak mahu.

324
00:14:27,033 --> 00:14:27,867
Javadi?

325
00:14:28,576 --> 00:14:31,371
Anak perempuan Raymond dan Eileen?

326
00:14:32,038 --> 00:14:33,956
Saya datang sambutan bayi mereka.

327
00:14:34,624 --> 00:14:36,334
Dia residen. Awak dalam kandungan.

328
00:14:38,419 --> 00:14:40,588
Entah bagaimana
dia lalui zaman itu dan latihan.

329
00:14:41,214 --> 00:14:42,298
Mari sertai saya.

330
00:14:42,757 --> 00:14:44,550
Syif saya tamat sebentar tadi.

331
00:14:45,134 --> 00:14:48,261
Okey. Semua pakai pelitup muka.
Dua gaun steril.

332
00:14:48,262 --> 00:14:50,806
Tuala pembedahan. Perlukan Betadine.

333
00:14:50,807 --> 00:14:52,308
Ini peluang yang baik.

334
00:14:53,643 --> 00:14:54,893
Saya keletihan.

335
00:14:54,894 --> 00:14:58,230
Ketua pembedahan saraf,
dia seorang legenda.

336
00:14:58,231 --> 00:14:59,690
Mungkin syif malam bantu?

337
00:15:00,233 --> 00:15:02,609
Adakah sebab kes volvulus tadi?

338
00:15:02,610 --> 00:15:05,029
Jika ya, awak buat silap.
Teruskan hidup.

339
00:15:05,988 --> 00:15:07,155
Saya tak nak balik sini

340
00:15:07,156 --> 00:15:09,867
dan tahu awak mohon residensi
bidang dermatologi.

341
00:15:11,077 --> 00:15:12,912
Pergi ikut dia. Lakukannya.

342
00:15:13,621 --> 00:15:15,706
- Javadi akan bantu.
- Hebat.

343
00:15:16,416 --> 00:15:18,291
Eileen buat EVD pertama dengan saya

344
00:15:18,292 --> 00:15:20,420
ketika saya penolong profesor.

345
00:15:22,171 --> 00:15:23,256
Masa berlalu pantas.

346
00:15:26,384 --> 00:15:28,594
- Okey, Grady?
- Masih tak masuk.

347
00:15:29,095 --> 00:15:30,929
- Lebih stabil?
- Tak juga.

348
00:15:30,930 --> 00:15:31,764
Rasa letih?

349
00:15:33,724 --> 00:15:35,810
- Ada Aerogen?
- Hanya di unit.

350
00:15:36,394 --> 00:15:37,645
Boleh dapat segera?

351
00:15:37,979 --> 00:15:39,772
- Dua minit, naik tangga.
- Pergi.

352
00:15:40,356 --> 00:15:41,523
Aerogen?

353
00:15:41,524 --> 00:15:46,070
Ia ada jaringan lima milimeter
bergetar lebih 120,000 kali sesaat.

354
00:15:51,993 --> 00:15:53,035
Dr. Al-Hashimi?

355
00:15:57,748 --> 00:15:58,708
Awak okey?

356
00:16:01,294 --> 00:16:03,212
Awak cakap tentang Aerogen tadi.

357
00:16:04,547 --> 00:16:05,756
Dr. Shen boleh jelaskan.

358
00:16:07,175 --> 00:16:10,177
Ia hasilkan titisan
dalam dua hingga lima mikron

359
00:16:10,178 --> 00:16:11,596
untuk hantar ubat...

360
00:16:19,562 --> 00:16:21,938
- Bagaimana?
- Baru nak mula.

361
00:16:21,939 --> 00:16:24,692
Pasang salur arteri.
Ukur dua kali, potong sekali.

362
00:16:25,610 --> 00:16:28,445
Masuk 11 sentimeter
ke belakang dari nasion...

363
00:16:28,446 --> 00:16:30,864
- Ya.
- ...tiga sentimeter sisi.

364
00:16:30,865 --> 00:16:32,532
Tanpa pengimejan langsung?

365
00:16:32,533 --> 00:16:34,535
Ya, terus ke ventrikel lateral.

366
00:16:35,578 --> 00:16:38,247
Terbukti berkesan sejak tahun 1890.

367
00:16:39,081 --> 00:16:41,167
Okey. Teruskan buat hirisan.

368
00:16:42,919 --> 00:16:45,086
Awak pernah bekerja
dengan Dr. Al-Hashimi.

369
00:16:45,087 --> 00:16:47,006
- Ya.
- Berapa lama?

370
00:16:47,757 --> 00:16:51,219
Semasa rotasi R2 saya
dan sekali lagi tahun lepas.

371
00:16:55,306 --> 00:16:56,224
Okey.

372
00:16:57,058 --> 00:16:57,975
Gerudi tangan sedia.

373
00:16:58,559 --> 00:16:59,809
Mungkin awak patut buat.

374
00:16:59,810 --> 00:17:01,938
Ada penyekat.
Takkan gerudi terlalu dalam.

375
00:17:02,730 --> 00:17:04,023
Bukan pembedahan otak.

376
00:17:06,943 --> 00:17:07,818
Okey?

377
00:17:11,364 --> 00:17:12,822
Tegak lurus.

378
00:17:12,823 --> 00:17:13,908
- Okey.
- Bagus.

379
00:17:15,243 --> 00:17:18,078
Sekarang, empat pusingan ke luar...

380
00:17:18,079 --> 00:17:19,329
- Ya.
- ...separuh lagi

381
00:17:19,330 --> 00:17:20,623
sehingga tembus tengkorak.

382
00:17:32,134 --> 00:17:33,386
Tiga,

383
00:17:34,554 --> 00:17:35,470
empat.

384
00:17:35,471 --> 00:17:36,347
Satu.

385
00:17:38,933 --> 00:17:43,062
Wah, ingatkan Tom Cruise tadi.

386
00:17:43,980 --> 00:17:45,856
Bagus. Apa rasanya, Digby?

387
00:17:46,941 --> 00:17:48,441
- Agak bagus.
- Mestilah.

388
00:17:48,442 --> 00:17:51,445
Apa kata kita rapikan
rambut cantik awak?

389
00:17:53,155 --> 00:17:55,198
Saya tak suka rambut dipotong.

390
00:17:55,199 --> 00:17:58,119
Faham, Rapunzel,
tapi awak perlu buat.

391
00:17:58,995 --> 00:18:00,620
Segar dengan wajah musim panas

392
00:18:00,621 --> 00:18:02,164
yang pasti dipandang wanita.

393
00:18:04,667 --> 00:18:06,377
- Mungkin sikit saja.
- Bagus.

394
00:18:06,961 --> 00:18:08,296
Saya nak buat <i>pixie.</i>

395
00:18:09,380 --> 00:18:10,673
- Apa?
- Gurau saja.

396
00:18:11,132 --> 00:18:12,757
Saya buat pada suami, Benji.

397
00:18:12,758 --> 00:18:15,845
Awak pasti kacak.
Bilakah kali terakhir awak potong?

398
00:18:17,555 --> 00:18:20,224
Mungkin majlis kahwin anak saya
beberapa tahun lalu.

399
00:18:21,058 --> 00:18:22,142
Di mana?

400
00:18:22,143 --> 00:18:24,562
St. Sebastian,
Our Lady of Mount Carmel Parish.

401
00:18:25,479 --> 00:18:27,023
Anak awak tahu awak di mana?

402
00:18:27,898 --> 00:18:29,984
Ya. Kami tinggal di Pittsburgh.

403
00:18:31,235 --> 00:18:33,029
Malah, dia tinggal
di rumah lama saya.

404
00:18:36,073 --> 00:18:38,909
- Dia tinggal di rumah lama awak?
- Ya.

405
00:18:40,369 --> 00:18:41,412
Awak pula di mana?

406
00:18:42,913 --> 00:18:44,040
Ke mana saya mahu.

407
00:18:46,667 --> 00:18:48,918
Tembusi lima hingga enam sentimeter

408
00:18:48,919 --> 00:18:51,047
dari dalam tengkorak, okey?

409
00:18:53,633 --> 00:18:54,759
Tengah,

410
00:18:55,676 --> 00:18:59,013
serenjang, sasarkan kantus medial.

411
00:19:00,348 --> 00:19:01,474
Silakan.

412
00:19:01,932 --> 00:19:03,017
Teruskan saja?

413
00:19:03,351 --> 00:19:05,936
Rasa sentakan
apabila tembus lapisan ependimal.

414
00:19:07,271 --> 00:19:08,938
Talian arteri dikalibrasi. Sedia.

415
00:19:08,939 --> 00:19:11,942
Tolong titrasi nikardipin
kepada MAP 85.

416
00:19:13,069 --> 00:19:15,446
Jika turunkan tekanan
intrakranial kepada 20?

417
00:19:17,740 --> 00:19:20,034
- Dr. Mohan?
- Maaf.

418
00:19:20,660 --> 00:19:22,495
MAP 85, ICP 20?

419
00:19:23,788 --> 00:19:25,955
Tekanan perfusi serebrum 65.

420
00:19:25,956 --> 00:19:28,334
Itu peluang terbaik
untuk terus hidup.

421
00:19:28,793 --> 00:19:32,088
Satu pertiga pesakit begini mati
atau cacat jangka panjang.

422
00:19:32,797 --> 00:19:34,631
Kita akan tahu dalam dua minggu

423
00:19:34,632 --> 00:19:35,841
untuk prognosis baik.

424
00:19:37,009 --> 00:19:39,428
- Rasa sentakan.
- Tanggalkan stilet.

425
00:19:42,431 --> 00:19:44,850
Okey, salirkan sikit.

426
00:19:47,144 --> 00:19:49,021
Sekarang, picit rapat-rapat.

427
00:19:50,690 --> 00:19:51,773
Sempurna.

428
00:19:51,774 --> 00:19:54,902
Tekanan darah turun, 190/88.
Denyutan jantung, 67.

429
00:19:59,198 --> 00:20:00,616
Apa khabar semua?

430
00:20:01,117 --> 00:20:03,034
Ya. Ada sikit kemajuan.

431
00:20:03,035 --> 00:20:05,538
- Nampak Abbot?
- Tak sejak rondaan tadi.

432
00:20:06,163 --> 00:20:08,457
Dia minta saya jumpa pesakit
bersama pelatih malam.

433
00:20:08,916 --> 00:20:09,875
Awak setuju?

434
00:20:10,376 --> 00:20:13,336
Wanita berusia 48 tahun,
jaundis baharu,

435
00:20:13,337 --> 00:20:16,298
peningkatan enzim hati,
tiada sejarah guna alkohol.

436
00:20:16,841 --> 00:20:20,510
Pilihlah. Hepatitis A,
B, C, D atau E.

437
00:20:20,511 --> 00:20:22,554
Tiada faktor risiko. Tiada demam.

438
00:20:22,555 --> 00:20:25,181
- Tylenol?
- Tak pernah. Tiada preskripsi.

439
00:20:25,182 --> 00:20:27,268
Dia makan hati beruang kutub?

440
00:20:28,644 --> 00:20:30,563
Boleh sebabkan ketoksikan vitamin A.

441
00:20:31,814 --> 00:20:32,772
- Tak.
- Ya.

442
00:20:32,773 --> 00:20:35,734
Dia tak makan daging.
Dia mementingkan kesihatan.

443
00:20:35,735 --> 00:20:39,154
Mungkin dia teguk minyak
hati ikan kod untuk cegah campak.

444
00:20:39,155 --> 00:20:40,322
Vegan, tak makan ikan.

445
00:20:41,073 --> 00:20:42,992
Boleh tengok dia?

446
00:20:43,826 --> 00:20:44,743
Serius?

447
00:20:44,744 --> 00:20:46,495
Awak mahir cam simptom pelik.

448
00:20:46,996 --> 00:20:48,414
Terimalah pujian itu.

449
00:20:50,040 --> 00:20:53,626
Okey. Lima minit pemeriksaan.

450
00:20:53,627 --> 00:20:55,545
Saya akan lama lagi di sini.

451
00:20:55,546 --> 00:20:56,672
Terima kasih.

452
00:20:58,007 --> 00:20:59,133
Apa saya kena...

453
00:21:02,720 --> 00:21:05,221
- Makin baik.
- Isi padu tidal meningkat.

454
00:21:05,222 --> 00:21:07,141
Dehitan ketika hembusan saja.

455
00:21:07,933 --> 00:21:10,352
- Ada perubahan.
- Rasa lebih baik, sayang?

456
00:21:11,312 --> 00:21:13,355
- Kamu buat mak takut.
- Tak baik.

457
00:21:14,607 --> 00:21:16,233
Adakah dia ada doktor?

458
00:21:17,026 --> 00:21:18,151
Sudah tiada.

459
00:21:18,152 --> 00:21:20,279
Bagaimanakah awak dapat ubat?

460
00:21:20,946 --> 00:21:23,948
Klinik kejiranan.
Kami bayar tunai. Albuterol murah.

461
00:21:23,949 --> 00:21:27,702
- Symbicort?
- Tanpa Medicaid, 400 dolar sebulan.

462
00:21:27,703 --> 00:21:29,121
Untuk alat sedut kecil?

463
00:21:31,290 --> 00:21:32,833
Trokar pada tiub.

464
00:21:33,793 --> 00:21:38,296
Jahit di bawah kulit kepala kira-kira
lima sentimeter dan cucuk melaluinya.

465
00:21:38,297 --> 00:21:40,299
- Untuk cegah jangkitan?
- Betul.

466
00:21:42,218 --> 00:21:44,428
Pegang buku jari
sementara saya tarik.

467
00:21:48,057 --> 00:21:49,642
Tutup luka dengan pengokot.

468
00:21:51,685 --> 00:21:53,937
Macam alat daripada Home Depot.

469
00:21:53,938 --> 00:21:55,522
Jualan murah Empat Julai.

470
00:21:55,523 --> 00:21:58,608
Tekanan otak diukur
dengan ketinggian turus bendalir.

471
00:21:58,609 --> 00:22:01,194
Kita perlu menentukurnya
kepada sifar pada aras tragus.

472
00:22:01,195 --> 00:22:03,446
Injap tiga hala dipasang,
sedia diguna.

473
00:22:03,447 --> 00:22:06,116
Troponin normal, tapi tunggu
untuk tolak kemungkinan MI.

474
00:22:07,326 --> 00:22:08,369
Mari cakap sekejap?

475
00:22:15,251 --> 00:22:18,294
Saya dah cuba pastikan
Orlando tak balik.

476
00:22:18,295 --> 00:22:22,382
Ya, saya pasti. Saya nak tanya awak
tentang Dr. Al-Hashimi di VA.

477
00:22:22,383 --> 00:22:25,052
Ada yang pelik tentang kelakuannya?

478
00:22:25,678 --> 00:22:27,136
Macam apa?

479
00:22:27,137 --> 00:22:29,639
Hilang fokus atau perhatian?

480
00:22:29,640 --> 00:22:31,559
Tak, dia sentiasa bagus.

481
00:22:35,229 --> 00:22:38,940
Tapi pagi ini, semasa periksa
keputusan ujian bayi Jane Doe,

482
00:22:38,941 --> 00:22:41,068
dia macam mengelamun beberapa saat.

483
00:22:42,862 --> 00:22:44,196
Mungkin dia penat.

484
00:22:51,537 --> 00:22:55,290
Tiada sumbatan, nodul atau sirosis.

485
00:22:55,291 --> 00:22:56,458
Hati yang cantik.

486
00:22:57,167 --> 00:22:58,377
Saya tak patut sakit.

487
00:22:58,961 --> 00:23:01,504
Saya bekerja keras untuk kekal sihat.

488
00:23:01,505 --> 00:23:04,465
Diet, senaman, tidur lapan jam.

489
00:23:04,466 --> 00:23:07,011
Tak ingat bila kali terakhir
saya tidur lapan jam.

490
00:23:08,512 --> 00:23:09,805
Awak kena cuba <i>sleepmaxxing.</i>

491
00:23:10,472 --> 00:23:12,140
Betul.

492
00:23:12,141 --> 00:23:14,602
Ya. Bilik sejuk,
hingar putih, penutup mata.

493
00:23:15,144 --> 00:23:18,230
Buah kiwi sebelum tidur,
air salad, pelekat mulut.

494
00:23:18,898 --> 00:23:20,107
Siapa yang awak ikuti?

495
00:23:20,649 --> 00:23:23,026
Pakar naturopati
dan penyembuh berfungsi.

496
00:23:23,027 --> 00:23:25,111
Awak beli vitamin mereka?

497
00:23:25,112 --> 00:23:28,239
Saya tak makan vitamin.
Makanan ialah ubat terbaik.

498
00:23:28,240 --> 00:23:31,076
Kale, beri biru,
kacang ginjal, kunyit.

499
00:23:31,577 --> 00:23:33,870
- Kunyit?
- Berapa lama awak makan?

500
00:23:33,871 --> 00:23:36,372
Beberapa bulan. Sifatnya antiradang.

501
00:23:36,373 --> 00:23:38,917
Nyahtoksik badan dan cegah Alzheimer.

502
00:23:38,918 --> 00:23:40,335
Berapa banyak?

503
00:23:40,336 --> 00:23:43,505
Kapsul 500mg.
Tapi saya ambil lima kapsul sehari.

504
00:23:45,341 --> 00:23:46,383
Apa?

505
00:23:47,009 --> 00:23:50,846
Dengan dos kunyit yang besar,
ada kes kegagalan hati direkodkan.

506
00:23:51,388 --> 00:23:53,056
Sebab makan rempah?

507
00:23:53,057 --> 00:23:56,226
Okey, Digby. Saya rasa awak dah siap.

508
00:23:56,644 --> 00:23:57,811
Awak nak tengok?

509
00:24:10,491 --> 00:24:12,951
Dah lama rupa saya tak begini.

510
00:24:12,952 --> 00:24:14,912
Keluarga awak takkan cam.

511
00:24:17,498 --> 00:24:19,457
Bagaimana mereka akan jumpa saya?

512
00:24:19,458 --> 00:24:22,585
Mereka takkan tahu rupa saya begini.

513
00:24:22,586 --> 00:24:26,298
Sudah tentu mereka tahu.
Mereka cam suara, tempat awak lepak.

514
00:24:26,799 --> 00:24:29,385
Malah ingat rupa awak dulu
pernah begini.

515
00:24:30,719 --> 00:24:32,179
Mereka ingat majlis itu.

516
00:24:35,557 --> 00:24:38,394
Awak menari dengan anak awak
di majlis itu?

517
00:24:40,771 --> 00:24:41,772
Ya.

518
00:24:43,023 --> 00:24:45,150
Maka, dia akan sentiasa ingat awak.

519
00:24:48,737 --> 00:24:49,863
- Ya.
- Okey.

520
00:24:51,699 --> 00:24:52,783
Saya cari awak.

521
00:24:53,450 --> 00:24:56,244
- Ada apa?
- Tentang pesakit asma itu.

522
00:24:56,245 --> 00:24:58,538
- Kenapa?
- Awak teragak-agak tadi.

523
00:24:58,539 --> 00:24:59,789
Awak sebut Aerogen.

524
00:24:59,790 --> 00:25:01,666
Adakah awak ragu-ragu?

525
00:25:01,667 --> 00:25:04,211
- Tak. Hanya berfikir.
- Tentang apa?

526
00:25:04,712 --> 00:25:07,881
Pelan rawatan terbaik untuknya
dan sudah diberikan.

527
00:25:09,008 --> 00:25:10,758
- Ada lagi?
- Cakaplah.

528
00:25:10,759 --> 00:25:12,261
Ada lagi saya perlu tahu?

529
00:25:13,095 --> 00:25:14,096
Saya rasa tidak.

530
00:25:16,015 --> 00:25:19,308
Dr. Robby di kecemasan.
Saya nak tanya tentang Ekins.

531
00:25:19,309 --> 00:25:21,686
Boleh padam nama Larson dan Stevens.

532
00:25:21,687 --> 00:25:23,772
- Selesai.
- Sedang diimbas?

533
00:25:25,065 --> 00:25:26,984
Bagus. Saya cuma nak sahkan.

534
00:25:27,609 --> 00:25:31,237
- Ada maklumat dari atas?
- Tiada apa yang kita belum tahu.

535
00:25:31,238 --> 00:25:32,530
Macam biasa?

536
00:25:32,531 --> 00:25:36,075
Agaknya patut kutip wang untuk Jesse?
Untuk ikat jamin?

537
00:25:36,076 --> 00:25:39,078
Biasanya tak boleh ikat jamin
sehingga jumpa hakim.

538
00:25:39,079 --> 00:25:41,080
Disebabkan cuti, mungkin Isnin nanti.

539
00:25:41,081 --> 00:25:44,168
- Dikurung sepanjang hujung minggu?
- Teruknya.

540
00:25:44,918 --> 00:25:45,878
Memang teruk.

541
00:25:47,212 --> 00:25:50,298
Dr. Langdon,
keadaan Grady jadi lebih teruk.

542
00:25:50,299 --> 00:25:52,092
- Perlu pakar?
- Tak, ada Shen.

543
00:25:53,052 --> 00:25:54,719
- Saturasi, 83.
- Apa jadi?

544
00:25:54,720 --> 00:25:55,804
Sebentar.

545
00:25:56,555 --> 00:25:59,932
Dia keletihan. Ketamin dan roc.
Masa untuk intubasi.

546
00:25:59,933 --> 00:26:01,059
Saya panggil Volk.

547
00:26:01,060 --> 00:26:04,062
Puan, kami perlu pasang
tiub pernafasan

548
00:26:04,063 --> 00:26:05,521
dan mesin bernafas untuknya.

549
00:26:05,522 --> 00:26:07,900
- Oh, Tuhan.
- Kejap.

550
00:26:08,442 --> 00:26:10,694
- Tiada gelinciran peparu kanan.
- Pneumotoraks.

551
00:26:11,195 --> 00:26:12,321
Tak perlu intubasi.

552
00:26:13,155 --> 00:26:15,741
- Apa yang berlaku?
- Paru-parunya kempis.

553
00:26:16,408 --> 00:26:19,827
Tiada sejarah trauma yang boleh
menyebabkan pneumotoraks.

554
00:26:19,828 --> 00:26:21,038
Pakai sarung tangan.

555
00:26:22,081 --> 00:26:23,916
Dalam asma, ada "perangkap udara".

556
00:26:24,416 --> 00:26:27,335
Apabila tak hembus sepenuhnya,
ia mengembang berlebihan,

557
00:26:27,336 --> 00:26:29,253
lalu kantung udara kecil pecah.

558
00:26:29,254 --> 00:26:30,380
Bagaimana caranya?

559
00:26:36,345 --> 00:26:37,262
Begitu.

560
00:26:43,143 --> 00:26:46,145
- Mujurlah Dr. Conley ada.
- Ya.

561
00:26:46,146 --> 00:26:48,397
Mari cuba carikan katil ICU neuro.

562
00:26:48,398 --> 00:26:50,025
Tak boleh hantar begini.

563
00:26:50,859 --> 00:26:52,903
- Robby.
- Bagaimana imbasan tadi?

564
00:26:53,654 --> 00:26:55,655
- Okey.
- Mungkin lambat sikit

565
00:26:55,656 --> 00:26:58,366
- untuk dapat analisis radiologi.
- Tak apa.

566
00:26:58,367 --> 00:27:02,245
Saya dan Jururawat Vivi perlu
masa untuk selaraskan jadual kami

567
00:27:02,246 --> 00:27:04,247
- beberapa bulan akan datang.
- Betul?

568
00:27:04,248 --> 00:27:05,456
Ya, saya ingin belajar

569
00:27:05,457 --> 00:27:08,000
cara tunggang motosikal
dan Duke nak tolong.

570
00:27:08,001 --> 00:27:10,378
Tiada siapa kenal
motosikal macam Duke.

571
00:27:10,379 --> 00:27:12,005
Dia beri diskaun staf kesihatan.

572
00:27:12,881 --> 00:27:15,217
Baiknya. Mari bawa dia ke biliknya.

573
00:27:15,968 --> 00:27:19,011
Sabtu depan okey, Vivi?

574
00:27:19,012 --> 00:27:21,223
Mungkin kita keluar makan
selepas itu.

575
00:27:22,015 --> 00:27:24,642
Dr. Mohan, Laurie Diaz sampai.
Dia nak jumpa suaminya.

576
00:27:24,643 --> 00:27:26,728
- Dia akan sampai.
- Okey. Saya datang.

577
00:27:29,273 --> 00:27:30,732
- Pn. Diaz?
- Hai.

578
00:27:31,191 --> 00:27:33,110
Orlando dah dapat bilik?

579
00:27:34,278 --> 00:27:37,572
- Tak.
- Saya bawa makanan dari Burgatory.

580
00:27:37,573 --> 00:27:40,284
Burger ayam. Tiada roti, hanya salad.

581
00:27:40,742 --> 00:27:42,661
Lagi sedap daripada makanan hospital.

582
00:27:46,623 --> 00:27:50,210
Dia sedang dirawat oleh pakar
kecederaan otak terbaik kami.

583
00:27:50,961 --> 00:27:52,336
Dia akan sedar?

584
00:27:52,337 --> 00:27:54,213
Belum pasti untuk beberapa minggu.

585
00:27:54,214 --> 00:27:56,341
Dia boleh kembali normal?

586
00:27:56,925 --> 00:27:59,927
Senario terbaik,
ambil masa kira-kira setahun

587
00:27:59,928 --> 00:28:01,346
sebelum dia boleh macam dulu.

588
00:28:02,723 --> 00:28:04,223
Senario terburuk?

589
00:28:04,224 --> 00:28:07,352
Penjagaan kejururawatan
sepanjang masa untuk kecacatan teruk.

590
00:28:11,523 --> 00:28:12,858
Awak biarkan dia balik.

591
00:28:13,567 --> 00:28:16,403
Dia berkeras untuk pergi
ke tempat kerja kedua.

592
00:28:17,863 --> 00:28:19,114
Awak tak boleh paksa?

593
00:28:19,907 --> 00:28:22,825
Dia mampu. Dia tahu risikonya.

594
00:28:22,826 --> 00:28:24,660
Kami hormat keputusannya.

595
00:28:24,661 --> 00:28:26,621
Walaupun keputusannya bodoh?

596
00:28:26,622 --> 00:28:27,997
Saya cuba halang dia.

597
00:28:27,998 --> 00:28:31,167
Saya tawarkan bekalan
untuk dia jaga diri di rumah.

598
00:28:31,168 --> 00:28:33,128
Tapi dia pergi
sebelum saya sempat beri.

599
00:28:33,712 --> 00:28:35,589
Dia tak sanggup tak dapat gaji.

600
00:28:43,764 --> 00:28:45,057
Dr. Langdon.

601
00:28:48,060 --> 00:28:48,977
Awak okey?

602
00:28:49,853 --> 00:28:51,063
Ya, cuma

603
00:28:53,023 --> 00:28:55,358
tak pasti saya dah sedia
untuk kembali.

604
00:28:55,359 --> 00:28:56,568
Sudah tentu sudah.

605
00:28:57,861 --> 00:28:59,779
Sepuluh bulan masa yang lama.

606
00:28:59,780 --> 00:29:02,157
Hampir bunuh pesakit dengan intubasi.

607
00:29:03,200 --> 00:29:05,494
Saya tak terfikir
untuk periksa pneumotoraks.

608
00:29:06,495 --> 00:29:08,079
Tiada trauma menandakan...

609
00:29:08,080 --> 00:29:09,122
- Patut sedar.
- Baik.

610
00:29:16,129 --> 00:29:17,172
Awak tahu, saya...

611
00:29:19,424 --> 00:29:20,801
Saya ada deposisi hari ini.

612
00:29:22,219 --> 00:29:24,887
Semua soalan peguam

613
00:29:24,888 --> 00:29:27,307
buat saya rasa macam
saya doktor yang amat teruk.

614
00:29:30,435 --> 00:29:33,605
Kita tak selalunya buat
dengan betul kali pertama.

615
00:29:34,898 --> 00:29:36,525
Awak pasti perasan keadaan dia.

616
00:29:37,526 --> 00:29:39,945
Mungkin ambil masa,
tapi awak pasti dapat bantu.

617
00:29:41,405 --> 00:29:43,698
Saya rasa Robby tak sependapat.

618
00:29:43,699 --> 00:29:45,951
Dia kritik saya seharian.

619
00:29:46,493 --> 00:29:50,163
Robby akan bercuti tiga bulan.
Dengan ketiadaan Robby,

620
00:29:51,081 --> 00:29:52,541
saya tak nak awak pun tiada.

621
00:29:56,670 --> 00:29:58,922
Alah bisa, tegal biasa.

622
00:30:00,549 --> 00:30:01,550
Friedrich Nietzsche.

623
00:30:02,634 --> 00:30:04,678
Ya. Nietzsche.

624
00:30:05,929 --> 00:30:06,930
Bukan Kelly Clarkson.

625
00:30:10,058 --> 00:30:12,226
Hei, tebalnya.

626
00:30:12,227 --> 00:30:14,855
Ya, Austin Green.
Pesakit <i>triple A</i> Ogilvie.

627
00:30:19,109 --> 00:30:20,568
G-R-E-E-N?

628
00:30:20,569 --> 00:30:21,986
Kenapa? Apa awak buat?

629
00:30:21,987 --> 00:30:24,489
Saya nak periksa
bila Ogilvie akan kembali.

630
00:30:25,741 --> 00:30:27,700
- Tak guna.
- Apa?

631
00:30:27,701 --> 00:30:31,537
Pesakit tak selamat.
Mati ketika dibedah, 40 minit lalu.

632
00:30:31,538 --> 00:30:33,540
Kalau begitu, di mana Ogilvie?

633
00:30:34,249 --> 00:30:35,624
Alamak.

634
00:30:35,625 --> 00:30:40,130
Ada imbasan CT setahun setengah lalu
menunjukkan <i>triple A</i> sepanjang 4cm.

635
00:30:40,672 --> 00:30:42,340
Terlalu kecil untuk dibedah.

636
00:30:42,341 --> 00:30:45,634
Dia patut datang semula
setiap enam bulan untuk ulangan,

637
00:30:45,635 --> 00:30:46,969
tapi tak datang.

638
00:30:46,970 --> 00:30:49,389
Kita pasti tahu
jika komputer berfungsi.

639
00:30:49,848 --> 00:30:51,807
Kenapa dia tak beritahu Ogilvie?

640
00:30:51,808 --> 00:30:55,103
Mungkin dia terlupa atau
Ogilvie tak tanya soalan yang betul.

641
00:30:56,438 --> 00:30:58,148
Dennis, ada masa sekejap?

642
00:30:58,857 --> 00:31:00,359
Sudah tentu. Nak apa?

643
00:31:00,942 --> 00:31:04,528
Remaja, barang kemas bermagnet
melekat pada kedua-dua belah septum.

644
00:31:04,529 --> 00:31:06,572
Saya cuba guna kuret plastik.

645
00:31:06,573 --> 00:31:08,491
Terlalu sakit dan berdarah.

646
00:31:08,492 --> 00:31:10,743
Perlu cabut sebelum kerosakan kekal.

647
00:31:10,744 --> 00:31:14,121
Boleh awak cari senior atau pakar?

648
00:31:14,122 --> 00:31:16,165
Kami cuba siapkan kerja cepat.

649
00:31:16,166 --> 00:31:17,084
Semua sibuk.

650
00:31:20,003 --> 00:31:21,504
Saya dah tolong satu kes.

651
00:31:21,505 --> 00:31:22,756
Ya, okey.

652
00:31:23,673 --> 00:31:25,884
Keputusan makmal untuk wanita kuning.

653
00:31:27,135 --> 00:31:28,970
INR meningkat, 2.2.

654
00:31:29,513 --> 00:31:31,555
Hati bermasalah, tapi belum mati.

655
00:31:31,556 --> 00:31:35,267
Suruh dia berhenti makan kunyit.
Masuk wad untuk pemantauan dan LFT.

656
00:31:35,268 --> 00:31:37,687
- Okey. Pusat 10?
- Ya.

657
00:31:42,401 --> 00:31:43,485
<i>Sleepmaxxing?</i> Betul?

658
00:31:44,403 --> 00:31:45,945
Saya baca trend dalam talian.

659
00:31:45,946 --> 00:31:47,864
Itu rahsia awak
menangani pesakit sukar?

660
00:31:49,074 --> 00:31:52,535
Saya fikir, "Apa perkara paling bodoh
seseorang boleh buat?"

661
00:31:52,536 --> 00:31:53,537
Anggap mereka buat.

662
00:31:55,205 --> 00:31:57,248
Dia cuba untuk menjadi sihat.

663
00:31:57,249 --> 00:31:59,708
Ya, dengan menerima
nasihat orang bodoh.

664
00:31:59,709 --> 00:32:01,836
Kunyit disyorkan oleh ramai doktor.

665
00:32:01,837 --> 00:32:03,838
Dia perlu tanya doktor tentang dos

666
00:32:03,839 --> 00:32:06,507
atau semak dengan organisasi
bereputasi macam CDC.

667
00:32:06,508 --> 00:32:08,927
Terlupa. Sekarang,
tapak sisa toksik perubatan.

668
00:32:09,719 --> 00:32:12,222
Keadaannya agak teruk.

669
00:32:12,806 --> 00:32:15,015
Jika makin parah,
perlu pemindahan hati.

670
00:32:15,016 --> 00:32:17,018
Ya, sebab dia memang bodoh.

671
00:32:20,564 --> 00:32:22,898
Tak, saya sebenarnya hargai dia.

672
00:32:22,899 --> 00:32:25,360
Jaminan kerja kita bergantung
pada semua orang bodoh.

673
00:32:27,863 --> 00:32:28,947
Okey.

674
00:32:32,492 --> 00:32:34,161
Selamat malam, Perlah, Monica.

675
00:32:35,036 --> 00:32:36,705
Selamat malam, Dr. Robby.

676
00:32:36,997 --> 00:32:38,290
- Selamat malam.
- Babai.

677
00:32:39,374 --> 00:32:40,584
Awak boleh sambung bantu.

678
00:32:41,334 --> 00:32:44,003
Dana menyuruh saya rehat
sebelum syif esok.

679
00:32:44,004 --> 00:32:46,965
- Ya, hari awak dahsyat.
- Tak teruk sangat.

680
00:32:49,134 --> 00:32:50,760
Mengapa tiada keputusan Duke?

681
00:32:51,678 --> 00:32:53,804
Pesakit baharu, belum ada EHR.

682
00:32:53,805 --> 00:32:56,474
Saya boleh pergi ke radiologi
dan ambil cetakan.

683
00:32:56,475 --> 00:32:57,601
Terima kasih, Monica.

684
00:33:00,687 --> 00:33:03,898
Sedia uruskan yang lain.
Orlando sudah diuruskan.

685
00:33:03,899 --> 00:33:06,609
- Bagaimana dia?
- Keputusannya baik. CPP 22.

686
00:33:06,610 --> 00:33:09,488
Dia ada peluang untuk sembuh.

687
00:33:10,280 --> 00:33:11,656
Awak rasa dia ada peluang?

688
00:33:12,324 --> 00:33:15,368
Saya tak pasti
dia sebenarnya mahu hidup.

689
00:33:15,952 --> 00:33:16,869
Apa?

690
00:33:16,870 --> 00:33:19,622
Dia beritahu Samira,
dia berhutang $100,000,

691
00:33:19,623 --> 00:33:21,082
- hidupnya...
- Pn. Diaz.

692
00:33:24,294 --> 00:33:26,713
- Boleh kami bantu?
- Tandas?

693
00:33:27,672 --> 00:33:29,299
Perlah boleh tunjukkan.

694
00:33:31,718 --> 00:33:33,636
Tak baik cakap hal peribadi pesakit

695
00:33:33,637 --> 00:33:35,138
- di sini.
- Saya tahu.

696
00:33:37,057 --> 00:33:38,934
- Awak baru...
- Tapi tidak.

697
00:33:42,395 --> 00:33:44,147
Okey.

698
00:33:45,273 --> 00:33:47,108
Sudah berapa lama tersekat?

699
00:33:47,651 --> 00:33:49,151
Sekurang-kurangnya dua jam.

700
00:33:49,152 --> 00:33:51,487
- Bagaimana?
- Anting-anting saya.

701
00:33:51,488 --> 00:33:55,534
Saya nak pasang tiga warna
untuk nampak hebat semasa keluar.

702
00:33:56,284 --> 00:33:57,868
Saya suruh dia pasang sebelah,

703
00:33:57,869 --> 00:33:59,078
tapi dia tak dengar.

704
00:33:59,079 --> 00:34:01,705
Boleh jadi serius.
Jika kita tak keluarkan,

705
00:34:01,706 --> 00:34:04,292
bekalan darah terhenti
dan buat septum runtuh.

706
00:34:05,126 --> 00:34:08,171
Hidung saya boleh cacat?

707
00:34:11,007 --> 00:34:13,467
- Oh, Tuhan. Keluarkan.
- Itu rancangannya.

708
00:34:13,468 --> 00:34:15,511
Ya, dia sudah cuba. Sangat sakit.

709
00:34:15,512 --> 00:34:18,430
Sebab ia melekat
kerana magnet yang kuat.

710
00:34:18,431 --> 00:34:19,557
Ya.

711
00:34:19,558 --> 00:34:22,226
- Tak nak.
- Saya tak guna bahagian ini.

712
00:34:22,227 --> 00:34:25,145
Saya terbalikkan
dan guna pemegangnya.

713
00:34:25,146 --> 00:34:26,273
Tetap akan sakit.

714
00:34:26,856 --> 00:34:29,109
Mungkin tak. Jangan bergerak.

715
00:34:32,028 --> 00:34:33,029
Okey.

716
00:34:38,952 --> 00:34:39,786
Betul?

717
00:34:40,161 --> 00:34:41,454
Sungguh menakjubkan.

718
00:34:42,080 --> 00:34:45,124
Rasanya setengah jam lagi,
papan ini boleh dikembalikan ke stor.

719
00:34:45,125 --> 00:34:46,333
Dengan senang hati.

720
00:34:46,334 --> 00:34:47,585
- Dr. Robinavitch?
- Ya.

721
00:34:47,586 --> 00:34:48,878
Keputusan kawan awak.

722
00:34:53,967 --> 00:34:55,844
- Sial.
- Duke?

723
00:35:00,098 --> 00:35:01,182
Awak akan beritahu dia?

724
00:35:02,100 --> 00:35:03,392
Saya nak jumpa pakar dulu.

725
00:35:03,393 --> 00:35:05,561
Dr. Robby,
saya ada maklumat terkini pesakit.

726
00:35:05,562 --> 00:35:06,730
- Tiada...
- Nanti.

727
00:35:07,230 --> 00:35:09,356
- Ingatkan awak nak balik?
- Ya.

728
00:35:09,357 --> 00:35:12,776
Dr. Ogilvie duduk di ruang ambulans
dan berlumuran darah.

729
00:35:12,777 --> 00:35:14,403
Apa yang dia buat di luar?

730
00:35:14,404 --> 00:35:16,447
Pandangannya kosong.

731
00:35:16,448 --> 00:35:18,699
Saya cuba cakap, tapi dia tak dengar.

732
00:35:18,700 --> 00:35:20,784
Monica, boleh hubungi kardiotorasik?

733
00:35:20,785 --> 00:35:22,871
- Saya akan tengok Ogilvie.
- Ya.

734
00:35:38,053 --> 00:35:39,262
Hei, Ogilvie.

735
00:35:42,641 --> 00:35:43,558
Ogilvie.

736
00:35:45,143 --> 00:35:46,144
Awak okey?

737
00:35:51,983 --> 00:35:55,528
- 99 pada dua liter.
- Dehitan tak jelas ketika hembus.

738
00:35:56,154 --> 00:35:57,489
Dia jauh lebih baik.

739
00:35:58,365 --> 00:36:01,451
- Steroid itu akan beri kesan.
- Dia akan pulih.

740
00:36:03,745 --> 00:36:04,663
Bila boleh pulang?

741
00:36:05,246 --> 00:36:10,000
Dalam sehari dua. Kami juga
akan bekalkan alat sedut Symbicort.

742
00:36:10,001 --> 00:36:11,252
Boleh bertahan sebulan.

743
00:36:12,170 --> 00:36:14,130
Harap dapat guna Medicaid semula.

744
00:36:14,714 --> 00:36:15,674
Kenapa terhenti?

745
00:36:16,841 --> 00:36:20,095
Mereka hantar surat penentuan
ke apartmen lama kami.

746
00:36:20,595 --> 00:36:21,805
Kami tak dapat surat.

747
00:36:22,847 --> 00:36:24,807
Apabila saya ambil preskripsi,

748
00:36:24,808 --> 00:36:27,268
farmasi kata
kami tak lagi dilindungi.

749
00:36:28,770 --> 00:36:30,896
Selepas itu, masih tak dapat?

750
00:36:30,897 --> 00:36:32,565
Saya dah cuba berbulan-bulan.

751
00:36:33,358 --> 00:36:36,486
Untuk dapatkan semula,
perlukan borang cukai dan slip gaji.

752
00:36:37,195 --> 00:36:39,531
Saya tukang gunting.
Pendapatan berubah-ubah.

753
00:36:40,198 --> 00:36:42,449
Ramai pelanggan tetap saya bergelut.

754
00:36:42,450 --> 00:36:45,370
Jadi, memang sukar.

755
00:36:45,912 --> 00:36:49,206
Jika Symbicort awak habis
sebelum Medicaid disambung,

756
00:36:49,207 --> 00:36:51,793
awak boleh kembali
dan kami akan berikan.

757
00:36:53,420 --> 00:36:54,753
Ada pesakit di sini?

758
00:36:54,754 --> 00:36:57,298
Sebab semua di sini
nampak sangat sihat.

759
00:36:58,007 --> 00:37:00,260
Saya dan Dr. Shen akan pantau Grady.

760
00:37:00,719 --> 00:37:04,180
- Syif siang, kami boleh uruskan.
- Awak akan dijaga.

761
00:37:06,307 --> 00:37:07,392
Saya sangat takut tadi.

762
00:37:08,768 --> 00:37:09,602
Terima kasih.

763
00:37:11,813 --> 00:37:12,897
Sama-sama.

764
00:37:17,318 --> 00:37:19,654
Disebabkan kecederaan,
situasinya berubah.

765
00:37:21,322 --> 00:37:23,782
Saya sedang cari Dr. Abbot.

766
00:37:23,783 --> 00:37:25,368
Agak lama tak nampak dia.

767
00:37:26,619 --> 00:37:27,620
Maafkan saya.

768
00:37:30,832 --> 00:37:34,127
Disebabkan kecacatan jangka panjang,
situasi mungkin lebih mudah.

769
00:37:35,754 --> 00:37:37,004
"Lebih mudah"?

770
00:37:37,005 --> 00:37:39,631
Dia layak terima
Medicare dan Medicaid.

771
00:37:39,632 --> 00:37:42,259
Selepas ini, kos rawatan ditanggung,

772
00:37:42,260 --> 00:37:45,012
- termasuk penjagaan di rumah.
- Okey.

773
00:37:45,013 --> 00:37:46,722
Mungkin bukan masa yang terbaik...

774
00:37:46,723 --> 00:37:49,392
Saya beri jaminan
tentang kos akan datang.

775
00:37:58,318 --> 00:38:00,612
- Robby.
- Noelle.

776
00:38:02,280 --> 00:38:03,614
Awak masih di sini.

777
00:38:03,615 --> 00:38:05,575
Bukan hari terbaik
untuk balik tepat masa.

778
00:38:07,494 --> 00:38:10,329
- Nampaknya kita takkan jumpa lama.
- Melainkan awak ikut.

779
00:38:10,330 --> 00:38:12,207
Tak, tapi terima kasih.

780
00:38:12,791 --> 00:38:15,418
- Walaupun bukan tawaran ikhlas.
- Apa maksud awak?

781
00:38:15,877 --> 00:38:17,294
Tolonglah. Saya cukup tahu

782
00:38:17,295 --> 00:38:19,756
untuk tak ganggu lelaki
dalam pencarian visi.

783
00:38:21,716 --> 00:38:25,970
- "Pencarian visi."
- Itu cara baik untuk katakannya.

784
00:38:27,639 --> 00:38:30,641
Saya mungkin tak nak dengar
versi tak baik.

785
00:38:30,642 --> 00:38:31,810
Mungkin tidak.

786
00:38:33,728 --> 00:38:36,022
Saya harap awak bukan

787
00:38:37,398 --> 00:38:38,941
lari daripada saya.

788
00:38:38,942 --> 00:38:41,027
Saya dah dewasa.
Boleh suruh saya berambus.

789
00:38:41,611 --> 00:38:43,279
Bukan sebab awak.

790
00:38:43,905 --> 00:38:46,991
Betul. Ayat lama,
"Bukan salah awak, tapi salah saya"?

791
00:38:48,910 --> 00:38:50,537
Dalam hal ini, memang benar.

792
00:38:57,544 --> 00:38:58,545
Maaf.

793
00:39:05,301 --> 00:39:07,511
- Jumpa minggu depan.
- Cuti tiga bulan.

794
00:39:07,512 --> 00:39:09,222
Saya cakap, jumpa minggu depan.

795
00:39:16,688 --> 00:39:18,481
Hari pertama saya di sini,

796
00:39:19,732 --> 00:39:21,234
ada seorang pesakit.

797
00:39:23,111 --> 00:39:26,364
Dia lelaki yang sangat baik.
Datang sebab sakit perut.

798
00:39:27,866 --> 00:39:31,285
Saya nampak batu hempedu
pada ultrabunyi,

799
00:39:31,286 --> 00:39:34,663
EKG normal, troponin.
Kesakitannya hilang.

800
00:39:34,664 --> 00:39:38,418
Dia berada di koridor
semasa alami serangan jantung.

801
00:39:41,754 --> 00:39:42,797
Saya gagal selamatkan.

802
00:39:44,424 --> 00:39:45,425
Pesakit mati.

803
00:39:47,427 --> 00:39:49,512
Kita cuba semampunya.

804
00:39:51,097 --> 00:39:52,307
Tapi pesakit tetap mati.

805
00:39:54,559 --> 00:39:56,019
Awak dapat biasakan diri?

806
00:39:58,271 --> 00:39:59,188
Tak.

807
00:40:01,024 --> 00:40:01,941
Tak, kita...

808
00:40:04,110 --> 00:40:05,236
Kita cuba terima.

809
00:40:07,780 --> 00:40:08,823
Cari keseimbangan.

810
00:40:15,038 --> 00:40:17,540
Saya tak tahu
jika dapat bertahan lagi.

811
00:40:19,500 --> 00:40:22,211
Pengkhususan penjagaan primer
kedengaran lebih baik.

812
00:40:22,962 --> 00:40:23,838
Mungkin pediatrik.

813
00:40:24,631 --> 00:40:25,840
Ya, mungkin.

814
00:40:27,675 --> 00:40:30,637
Saya pula pasti akan bosan.

815
00:40:32,138 --> 00:40:36,224
Serius, saya suka cabaran penyakit
yang tak didiagnosis,

816
00:40:36,225 --> 00:40:40,313
keputusan pantas,
prosedur yang menyelamatkan nyawa.

817
00:40:41,272 --> 00:40:45,360
Saya juga suka bantu orang
pada hari terburuk hidup mereka.

818
00:40:54,202 --> 00:40:55,328
Awak nak tahu?

819
00:40:56,454 --> 00:40:57,496
Apa?

820
00:40:57,497 --> 00:40:59,415
Saya rasa awak patut pulang.

821
00:41:00,458 --> 00:41:01,708
Fikir masak-masak,

822
00:41:01,709 --> 00:41:03,919
patut tunggu sehingga pagi esok

823
00:41:03,920 --> 00:41:05,046
untuk buat keputusan.

824
00:41:09,008 --> 00:41:12,929
Saya tak nak masuk semula
dan jumpa sesiapa.

825
00:41:13,763 --> 00:41:14,639
Ya.

826
00:41:16,557 --> 00:41:18,226
Tanggalkan gaun, saya akan ambil.

827
00:41:19,143 --> 00:41:20,269
Syif dah tamat.

828
00:41:21,813 --> 00:41:22,689
Baliklah.

829
00:41:36,494 --> 00:41:37,744
- Oh. Tuhan.
- Tak...

830
00:41:37,745 --> 00:41:39,246
- Maaf.
- Saya okey.

831
00:41:39,247 --> 00:41:41,249
Ada patung di kerusi roda.

832
00:41:41,791 --> 00:41:43,084
Dia bergerak-gerak.

833
00:41:46,337 --> 00:41:47,922
Nampaknya saya digantikan.

834
00:41:49,048 --> 00:41:50,298
Saya ambil tempat awak?

835
00:41:50,299 --> 00:41:51,800
- Tak juga.
- Awak pasti?

836
00:41:51,801 --> 00:41:53,135
Ke mana awak pergi?

837
00:41:53,136 --> 00:41:55,680
- Saya jumpa Ogilvie.
- Dan?

838
00:41:56,222 --> 00:41:57,682
Dia pulang ke rumah.

839
00:41:58,641 --> 00:41:59,641
Itu saja?

840
00:41:59,642 --> 00:42:00,977
Panjang ceritanya.

841
00:42:01,394 --> 00:42:04,855
- Saya ada masa.
- Saya perlu hormat privasinya.

842
00:42:04,856 --> 00:42:06,357
Tak seronoklah.

843
00:42:07,150 --> 00:42:08,067
Maaf.

844
00:42:17,243 --> 00:42:20,413
- Mesin tersekat.
- Ya, cuba terbalikkan.

845
00:42:23,833 --> 00:42:25,501
- Baguslah.
- Tepuk manja sikit.

846
00:42:26,836 --> 00:42:28,004
- Okey.
- Tendanglah.

847
00:42:29,505 --> 00:42:31,340
Demi Tuhan.

848
00:42:33,342 --> 00:42:35,469
Rasanya En. Digby dapat bilik wad.

849
00:42:35,470 --> 00:42:38,014
- Beranganlah.
- Dia tiada di Selatan 21.

850
00:42:38,931 --> 00:42:41,559
- Ya, ada.
- Ada lelaki lain di atas katil.

851
00:42:42,727 --> 00:42:45,605
Rambut pendek, dicukur bersih?
Saya akan uruskan.

852
00:42:47,023 --> 00:42:50,108
Filem tunjukkan patologi jelas,
kami minta angiogram CT.

853
00:42:50,109 --> 00:42:52,862
Aneurisme aorta menaik yang lazim.
Lapan sentimeter.

854
00:42:53,654 --> 00:42:55,489
Peratus kematian, 50% setahun.

855
00:42:55,490 --> 00:42:57,824
- Dia perlu dibedah?
- Jika mahu hidup.

856
00:42:57,825 --> 00:42:59,951
Dia kawan saya.
Saya akan beritahu dia.

857
00:42:59,952 --> 00:43:01,996
- Rujukan awak.
- Bukan hari ini.

858
00:43:02,914 --> 00:43:04,664
- Kenapa?
- Kena jumpa kardiologi

859
00:43:04,665 --> 00:43:06,500
dan peparu untuk boleh dibedah.

860
00:43:06,501 --> 00:43:08,460
Buat gema tekanan, PFT.

861
00:43:08,461 --> 00:43:10,670
Dia perlu masuk wad dan dinilai.

862
00:43:10,671 --> 00:43:12,422
Tak sempat pada cuti hujung minggu.

863
00:43:12,423 --> 00:43:14,674
- Rehat di rumah.
- Dia macam bom jangka.

864
00:43:14,675 --> 00:43:16,093
Mungkin dah lama begitu.

865
00:43:16,094 --> 00:43:19,054
Boleh masuk awal minggu depan
dan pakar buat ujian.

866
00:43:19,055 --> 00:43:21,098
Kalau okey, dibedah dalam seminggu.

867
00:43:21,099 --> 00:43:23,559
- Kalau pecah awal?
- Hubungi 911.

868
00:43:24,727 --> 00:43:26,019
Maaf. Ini cara terbaik.

869
00:43:26,020 --> 00:43:27,897
Beri nombornya. Kerani saya uruskan.

870
00:43:30,233 --> 00:43:31,484
- Sial!
- Hei!

871
00:43:31,984 --> 00:43:33,528
Pergi ambil angin. Cepat.

872
00:43:38,116 --> 00:43:40,450
- Dua untuk discaj.
- Jangan tekan loceng.

873
00:43:40,451 --> 00:43:42,327
Sistem dah pulih.

874
00:43:42,328 --> 00:43:45,038
Bukan untuk mereka berdua.
Masih tiada rekod elektronik.

875
00:43:45,039 --> 00:43:46,331
Tunggu.

876
00:43:46,332 --> 00:43:49,876
Pesakit ini patut ada X-ray.
Tak ada pun?

877
00:43:49,877 --> 00:43:52,587
Pesakit wanita ski air
masih tunggu X-ray lutut.

878
00:43:52,588 --> 00:43:55,508
Saya batalkan X-ray.
Saya guna ultrabunyi.

879
00:43:56,300 --> 00:43:58,219
- Betul?
- Ya.

880
00:43:59,303 --> 00:44:01,680
Budak itu patah tulang
mampatan ringan.

881
00:44:01,681 --> 00:44:04,224
Radius distal.
Dia diberi anduh Velcro.

882
00:44:04,225 --> 00:44:07,060
Pn. Stegman,
koyakan kecil pada meniskus medial.

883
00:44:07,061 --> 00:44:09,479
Pendakap lutut, tongkat
dan susulan ortopedik.

884
00:44:09,480 --> 00:44:11,773
Awak patut ada semasa syif siang.

885
00:44:11,774 --> 00:44:14,401
Kami tak diajar tentang
ultrabunyi muskuloskeletal.

886
00:44:14,402 --> 00:44:17,363
Sebab itu saya ambil elektif
di Harvard dan Highland.

887
00:44:18,531 --> 00:44:20,533
Awak mohon
fellowship ultrabunyi di sini?

888
00:44:21,284 --> 00:44:23,369
Ya, tapi persaingannya sengit.

889
00:44:24,078 --> 00:44:26,163
- Itulah yang saya dengar.
- Agak sukar.

890
00:44:26,164 --> 00:44:29,082
Saya ada satu penerbitan,
tapi hanya siri laporan kes

891
00:44:29,083 --> 00:44:31,544
mendiagnosis kehelan bahu
guna ultrabunyi.

892
00:44:32,044 --> 00:44:34,087
Jika nak belajar MSK, boleh ikut.

893
00:44:34,088 --> 00:44:36,799
- Ada tiga lagi untuk diimbas.
- Mungkin lain kali.

894
00:44:37,508 --> 00:44:38,426
Okey.

895
00:44:42,513 --> 00:44:44,265
Jangan biar mesin tersekat.

896
00:44:44,765 --> 00:44:45,849
Dua carta?

897
00:44:45,850 --> 00:44:47,935
Permohonan fellowship
ultrabunyi saya.

898
00:44:50,730 --> 00:44:51,689
Hei.

899
00:44:52,648 --> 00:44:54,483
Maaf tentang pesakit awak.

900
00:44:55,109 --> 00:44:56,903
Ya, Orlando agak parah.

901
00:44:57,945 --> 00:45:00,947
Tak, saya sedang cakap
tentang pesakit <i>triple A</i>

902
00:45:00,948 --> 00:45:02,491
yang awak dan Ogilvie jaga.

903
00:45:06,287 --> 00:45:07,914
Dia tak selamat.

904
00:45:08,706 --> 00:45:11,542
Saya cuba beritahu Robby,
tapi dia sibuk.

905
00:45:12,335 --> 00:45:13,377
Saya minta diri.

906
00:45:16,422 --> 00:45:17,423
Alamak.

907
00:45:22,178 --> 00:45:25,430
Awak kata saya gelisah?
Awak malukan Samira, McKay...

908
00:45:25,431 --> 00:45:28,016
Mereka berdua perlu ditegur.

909
00:45:28,017 --> 00:45:30,310
Tegur bersemuka.
Awak juga cakap lepas

910
00:45:30,311 --> 00:45:32,396
pesakit mungkin bunuh diri.
Hentak barang?

911
00:45:32,939 --> 00:45:35,857
Tolong. Selesaikan urusan awak
dan pergi dari sini.

912
00:45:35,858 --> 00:45:36,859
Tak boleh.

913
00:45:37,276 --> 00:45:39,319
Boleh. Apabila anak saya
buat perangai,

914
00:45:39,320 --> 00:45:41,655
- mereka dihukum ke bilik.
- Awak bukan ibu saya.

915
00:45:41,656 --> 00:45:43,698
Ya? Sayang sekali. Awak perlukannya.

916
00:45:43,699 --> 00:45:45,492
Dulu. Saya tak perlukan satu lagi.

917
00:45:45,493 --> 00:45:47,953
Saya nak orang yang jaga jabatan
semasa saya tiada.

918
00:45:47,954 --> 00:45:49,829
Saya minta maaf. Saya tak tahu.

919
00:45:49,830 --> 00:45:52,083
Tiada siapa tahu. Siapa yang peduli?

920
00:45:52,875 --> 00:45:54,000
Awak perlu rehat.

921
00:45:54,001 --> 00:45:57,254
- Itulah tujuan cuti panjang.
- Pergilah sekarang.

922
00:45:57,255 --> 00:46:00,131
- Terlalu banyak urusan.
- Biar orang lain uruskan Duke.

923
00:46:00,132 --> 00:46:02,551
- Tak, saya kena buat sendiri.
- Kenapa?

924
00:46:03,135 --> 00:46:04,719
Setidaknya itu saya patut buat.

925
00:46:04,720 --> 00:46:06,596
Dia perlu tahu daripada kawan.

926
00:46:06,597 --> 00:46:08,640
Jika tak, dia akan lari dan mati.

927
00:46:08,641 --> 00:46:11,060
Okey, selesaikan dan balik.

928
00:46:12,103 --> 00:46:14,980
Bukan Duke saja.
Saya tak pasti Al-Hashimi sesuai.

929
00:46:14,981 --> 00:46:16,356
- Apa maksudnya?
- Entah.

930
00:46:16,357 --> 00:46:17,482
Saya cuba faham.

931
00:46:17,483 --> 00:46:19,901
Awak tahu dia mahu
dua pakar setiap masa?

932
00:46:19,902 --> 00:46:20,902
- Tak.
- Dia bincang

933
00:46:20,903 --> 00:46:23,029
- dengan Gloria?
- Saya tak tahu.

934
00:46:23,030 --> 00:46:25,240
Saya tak tahu
jika Langdon akan kambuh.

935
00:46:25,241 --> 00:46:27,617
Tak tahu jika Whitaker
dapat uruskan rumah saya.

936
00:46:27,618 --> 00:46:29,911
Tak tahu jika Javadi
akan lepaskan peluang.

937
00:46:29,912 --> 00:46:32,289
Atau jika Samira marah sebab ibunya.

938
00:46:32,290 --> 00:46:33,791
- Ada lagi?
- Ya. Awak.

939
00:46:34,834 --> 00:46:36,835
Saya tak tahu awak

940
00:46:36,836 --> 00:46:38,670
bawa picagari penuh Versed.

941
00:46:38,671 --> 00:46:41,047
Saya risau tentang orang saya sayang.

942
00:46:41,048 --> 00:46:43,050
Kami dapat bertahan nanti.

943
00:46:43,884 --> 00:46:46,053
- Sentiasa begitu.
- Kalau saya tak kembali?

944
00:48:17,061 --> 00:48:19,063
Terjemahan oleh: NH Azizan

